        {
          "file": "patches/hexagonrpc/0002-hexagonrpcd-add-a-narrow-sns_registry-property-shim.patch",
          "sha256": "1fd0eb8b6f1731ab49c55fd88f02a9eba8054f0082897a05a5f6a25d55d37d6f",
          "origin": "xiaomipad-6pro-mainline (Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro port), unmodified except for the author identity",
          "origin_url": "https://github.com/yzddmr6/xiaomipad-6pro-mainline/blob/e08c1488ef03b2d737c16f01d0d22f7258fd3289/device/sensors/patches/0002-hexagonrpcd-add-a-narrow-sns_registry-property-shim.patch",
          "upstream_status": "not upstream"
        },
        {
          "file": "patches/hexagonrpc/0003-hexagonrpcd-serve-the-ODM-sensor-configuration-directory.patch",
          "sha256": "aafe8d77959bd05c6cb5327bfc8775c0a9145c9d253823dabcca36ccbf99400d",
          "origin": "this project",
          "upstream_status": "not submitted",
          "note": "The ADSP sensor image names both /vendor/etc/sensors/config (json.lst) and /odm/etc/sensor/config (json_list); the stock sns_reg_config points its config directory at the ODM path."
        },
        {
          "file": "patches/hexagonrpc/0004-hexagonrpcd-answer-apps_std-fopen_with_env_fd-lookups.patch",
          "sha256": "b233ec4ada75271c64a263e542e90f84a23f205de4e062f68b98b3f2eeb01ad4",
          "origin": "this project",
          "upstream_status": "not submitted",
          "note": "apps_std method 36 is fopen_with_env_fd in Qualcomm's apps_std IDL (quic/fastrpc src/apps_std_skel.c at d247519650fe5cb16de6c78edaa95bcc4be25073); the stock libadsprpc.so dispatcher accepts it only as sc 0x1f050100. Absent files answer ENOENT like the reference; serving a present file as a DSP-mapped buffer is not implemented and is refused with AEE_EUNSUPPORTED.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quic/fastrpc/d247519650fe5cb16de6c78edaa95bcc4be25073/src/apps_std_skel.c",
              "sha256": "0e3ff421cf2b7b6f3649fd2c17f0327daad8a5628157159dcebff12f688cdc91",
              "shows": "generated apps_std skel: extended method 36 -> apps_std_fopen_with_env_fd, 5 in / 1 out, 20-byte primary input, 8-byte primary output; unknown methods return AEE_EUNSUPPORTED"
            },
            {
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quic/fastrpc/d247519650fe5cb16de6c78edaa95bcc4be25073/inc/apps_std.h",
              "sha256": "170f337fefbaccc505e6560823e9aa2c35c9b9b150ba467fcf9fb54f776fcf08",
              "shows": "fopen_with_env_fd(envvarname, delim, name, mode, int *fd, int *len)"
            },
            {
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quic/fastrpc/d247519650fe5cb16de6c78edaa95bcc4be25073/src/apps_std_imp.c",
              "sha256": "2bb7d12565c495399259f5d1a16333bb14cf79245475ff9e41090563906188f3",
              "shows": "reference semantics: search the path, read into rpcmem, fastrpc_mmap(FASTRPC_MAP_FD), return fd/len; ENOENT when absent"
            },
            {
              "rom_file": "vendor.img:/lib64/libadsprpc.so",
              "sha256": "9f29121254586caa205f2471f5bead26e61487c8d298ea54d903bd636fde6f38",
              "shows": "stock dispatcher: extended ID 0x24 accepted only for scalars 0x050100, primary input >= 20 and output >= 8 bytes; handler logs apps_std_fopen_with_env_fd"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "file": "patches/hexagonrpc/0005-hexagonrpcd-keep-listening-after-refusing-a-request.patch",
          "sha256": "d1d62233e4bf8b6c587e8781a9d164fb6e62b8e86eb683c985f423a46906cfae",
          "origin": "this project",
          "upstream_status": "not submitted",
          "note": "Upstream hexagonrpcd exits on any refused request; the reference listener (quic/fastrpc src/listener_android.c) replies with the error and empty output buffers and keeps serving. Refusals stay logged.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quic/fastrpc/d247519650fe5cb16de6c78edaa95bcc4be25073/src/listener_android.c",
              "sha256": "d2659622e9b192b61d7ff5cbbf38dd348597290521c217155abc51f45ea0a7ab",
              "shows": "a non-zero result is sent back with outBufsLen = 0 and the loop continues"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
